{
  "node-home": {
    "caption": "Home",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div><div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\">\n<div class=\"m-hello\">Good afternoon</div>\n<div class=\"m-name\">Kagiso</div>\n<div class=\"m-quick-row\"><div class=\"m-quick snap\"><div class=\"q-icons\"><div class=\"q-ic main\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z\"></path><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2M12 19v4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"q-ic\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div></div><div class=\"q-label\">Snap &amp; Say</div><div class=\"q-sub\">AI voice + photo — say it, snap it</div></div><div class=\"m-quick form\"><div class=\"q-icons\"><div class=\"q-ic form-ic\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path><path d=\"M12 11v6M9 14h6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"q-label\">Report an issue</div><div class=\"q-sub\">Fill in a form · about 2 min</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"m-tiles\">\n<div class=\"m-pulse\">\n<div class=\"m-pulse-head\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"ph-eyebrow\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.5-7 11-7 11Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg>Your area</div>\n<div class=\"ph-title\">What's happening around you</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ph-see\">See all ›</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-pulse-scroll\">\n<div class=\"m-pulse-card poll\">\n<div class=\"pc-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#185FA5\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 12h6M9 16h6M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13\"></path><path d=\"M4 21h16\"></path></svg></div>\n<div class=\"pc-label\">Quick poll</div>\n<div class=\"pc-body\">Should this park get more lighting?</div>\n<div class=\"pc-yn\"><div>Yes</div><div>No</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-pulse-card stat\">\n<div class=\"pc-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0F6E56\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 20V10M12 20V4M20 20v-7\"></path></svg></div>\n<div class=\"pc-label\">Community pulse</div>\n<div class=\"pc-body\">72% say waste collection is improving</div>\n<div class=\"pc-meta\">Based on 340 responses</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-pulse-card trend\">\n<div class=\"pc-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BA7517\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18\"></path><path d=\"M17 6h6v6\"></path></svg></div>\n<div class=\"pc-label\">Trending issue</div>\n<div class=\"pc-body\">Streetlights — #1 reported this week</div>\n<div class=\"pc-meta\">Tap to view or report</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-tile\">\n<div class=\"t-icon\" style=\"background:var(--blue-tint);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#185FA5\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9l5 5v15a0 0 0 0 1 0 0H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z\"></path><path d=\"M8 8h6M8 12h8M8 16h8\"></path></svg></div>\n<div class=\"t-label\">News</div>\n<div class=\"t-meta\">4 new</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-tile\">\n<div class=\"t-icon\" style=\"background:var(--sage);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0F6E56\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"></path></svg></div>\n<div class=\"t-label\">Surveys</div>\n<div class=\"t-meta\">1 open</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"phone-bottomnav\">\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item active\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon": {
    "caption": "Beacon — live map, active shares & your circle (repurposed from the old bottom-nav Profile tab — new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div><div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\n<div class=\"bc-map\">\n<svg class=\"bc-grid\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#97C459\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M0 90 H320 M0 180 H320 M0 270 H320 M0 360 H320 M60 0 V560 M160 0 V560 M240 0 V560\"></path></svg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-pin me\" style=\"top:40%;left:46%;\"><div class=\"bc-pin-avatar\">K</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-pin live\" style=\"top:24%;left:72%;\"><div class=\"bc-pin-avatar\">T</div><div class=\"bc-pin-dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-pin live\" style=\"top:56%;left:20%;\"><div class=\"bc-pin-avatar\">N</div><div class=\"bc-pin-dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-topbar\">\n<div class=\"bc-title-pill\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>\n<div class=\"bc-add-btn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-sheet\">\n<div class=\"bc-sheet-handle\"></div>\n<div class=\"bc-cta-share\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg>Share my live location</div>\n<div class=\"bc-tabs\">\n<div class=\"bc-tab active\">Live now · 2</div>\n<div class=\"bc-tab\">My circle · 5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-member-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">T<div class=\"bc-live-badge\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Thabo Mkhize</div><div class=\"bc-status live\">Sharing · 6 min to you</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-msg-btn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2Z\"></path></svg></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-member-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">N<div class=\"bc-live-badge\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Nomvula Zulu</div><div class=\"bc-status live\">Sharing · walking home</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-msg-btn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2Z\"></path></svg></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"phone-bottomnav\">\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item active\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-mode": {
    "caption": "Beacon → \"Share my live location\" — choose how to share: live location, or draw a path (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content dim\" style=\"padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"bc-map\"><svg class=\"bc-grid\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#97C459\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M0 90 H320 M0 180 H320 M0 270 H320 M0 360 H320 M60 0 V560 M160 0 V560 M240 0 V560\"></path></svg></div>\n<div class=\"bc-topbar\"><div class=\"bc-title-pill\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"/></svg>Beacon</div><div class=\"bc-add-btn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"modal-backdrop\"><div class=\"sheet mode-sheet\">\n<div class=\"sheet-handle\"></div>\n<div class=\"sheet-title\">How do you want to share?</div>\n<div class=\"sheet-sub\">Choose how your circle follows you. You pick who sees it and for how long on the next step.</div>\n<div class=\"sh-use opt-live\" style=\"align-items:center;border-radius:14px;\"><div class=\"u-ic\" style=\"background:var(--beacon-tint);width:36px;height:36px;color:var(--beacon);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div class=\"u-t\">Share live location</div><div class=\"u-d\">Your circle sees you move on the map in real time. No route needed.</div></div><div style=\"color:#B0AFA5;width:14px;flex:0 0 auto;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></div></div>\n<div class=\"sh-use opt-draw\" style=\"align-items:center;border-radius:14px;\"><div class=\"u-ic\" style=\"background:var(--beacon-tint);width:36px;height:36px;color:var(--beacon);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M8.5 19H15a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7H9a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7h6.5\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div class=\"u-t\">Draw a path</div><div class=\"u-d\">Draw where you are going. Your circle follows your progress and is alerted if you stray off it.</div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;background:var(--beacon-tint);color:var(--beacon-deep);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 8px;\">Safer for walks</div></div><div style=\"color:#B0AFA5;width:14px;flex:0 0 auto;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></div></div>\n<div class=\"btn-flat ghost mode-cancel\" style=\"border-radius:99px;margin-top:4px;\">Cancel</div>\n</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-draw": {
    "caption": "Beacon → \"Draw a path\" — draw your route with a finger; shaded strip is the off-path alert zone (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"bc-map\"><svg class=\"bc-grid\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#97C459\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M0 90 H320 M0 180 H320 M0 270 H320 M0 360 H320 M60 0 V560 M160 0 V560 M240 0 V560\"></path></svg></div>\n<svg style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path class=\"draw-zone\" d=\"M60 385 C 75 340, 130 325, 140 285 S 95 235, 150 215 S 235 205, 225 165\" stroke=\"rgba(28,140,153,.16)\" stroke-width=\"34\"/><path class=\"draw-line\" d=\"M60 385 C 75 340, 130 325, 140 285 S 95 235, 150 215 S 235 205, 225 165\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/></svg>\n<div class=\"bc-route-dot\" style=\"top:385px;left:60px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\"></div>\n<div class=\"draw-start\" style=\"position:absolute;top:401px;left:60px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(22,36,31,.16);\">You are here</div>\n<div class=\"draw-end\" style=\"position:absolute;top:165px;left:225px;transform:translate(-50%,-92%);\"><svg fill=\"var(--beacon)\" height=\"32\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"32\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.5-7 11-7 11Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></div>\n<div class=\"bc-topbar draw-top\" style=\"justify-content:flex-start;gap:8px;\"><div class=\"draw-back\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(22,36,31,.16);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 auto;\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></span></div>\n<div class=\"bc-title-pill\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M12 20h9\"/><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z\"/></svg>Draw your path</div></div>\n<div class=\"draw-hint\" style=\"position:absolute;top:56px;left:12px;right:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 12px;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(22,36,31,.14);\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;\">Path drawn · 1.4 km · about 18 min</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2px;line-height:1.45;\">Drag your finger from where you are to where you are going. Lift to finish. The shaded strip is the alert zone.</div></div>\n<div class=\"draw-tools\" style=\"position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:10px;box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(22,36,31,.2);\">\n<div class=\"draw-zone-key\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 2px 9px;\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(28,140,153,.25);display:inline-block;flex:0 0 auto;\"></span>Alert zone · 100 m either side of your path</div>\n<div class=\"btn-row\">\n<div class=\"ll-addbtn draw-undo\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M9 14 4 9l5-5\"/><path d=\"M4 9h10.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 0 11H11\"/></svg></span>Undo</div>\n<div class=\"ll-addbtn draw-clear\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M3 6h18M8 6V4h8v2M6 6l1 14h10l1-14\"/></svg></span>Clear</div>\n<div class=\"ll-addbtn draw-next\" style=\"background:var(--beacon);border-color:var(--beacon);color:#fff;\">Next</div></div></div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-confirm": {
    "caption": "Beacon → Start sharing — choose who sees you, for how long, and the off-path alert (new). Live-location variant: no route card, no off-path alert row",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"padding-bottom:14px;\">\n<div class=\"m-chat-header\" style=\"border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:8px;\"><div class=\"ch-back\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></div><div><div class=\"ch-title\">Start sharing</div><div class=\"ch-sub\">Walk to Musgrave Centre · 1.4 km</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"cf-route\" style=\"position:relative;height:88px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:4px;\"><div class=\"bc-map\"><svg class=\"bc-grid\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#97C459\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M0 90 H320 M0 180 H320 M0 270 H320 M0 360 H320 M60 0 V560 M160 0 V560 M240 0 V560\"></path></svg></div>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 88\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M30 70 C 80 70, 90 30, 150 44 S 230 20, 270 18\" stroke=\"rgba(28,140,153,.18)\" stroke-width=\"16\"/><path d=\"M30 70 C 80 70, 90 30, 150 44 S 230 20, 270 18\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;background:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;\">~18 min · ETA 6:52 PM</div></div>\n<div class=\"m-sectiontitle\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:12px;\"><span>Share with</span><span style=\"color:var(--beacon-deep);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;\">Select all</span></div>\n<div class=\"cf-members\"><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">T</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Thabo Mkhize</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">In your circle</div></div><div class=\"cf-check on\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--beacon);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 auto;color:#fff;\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"m5 12 5 5 9-10\"/></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">N</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Nomvula Zulu</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">In your circle</div></div><div class=\"cf-check on\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--beacon);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 auto;color:#fff;\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:12px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"m5 12 5 5 9-10\"/></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">L</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Lindiwe Ngcobo</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">In your circle</div></div><div class=\"cf-check\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;flex:0 0 auto;\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"m-sectiontitle\">How long</div>\n<div class=\"cf-duration\" style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div class=\"cf-chip on\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 4px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap;background:var(--beacon-tint);border:1px solid var(--beacon);color:var(--beacon-deep);\">Until I arrive</div><div class=\"cf-chip\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 4px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft);\">30 min</div><div class=\"cf-chip\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 4px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft);\">1 hour</div><div class=\"cf-chip\" style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 4px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft);\">2 hours</div></div>\n<div class=\"cf-alert\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:14px;\">\n<div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--amber-tint);color:var(--amber);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 auto;\"><span style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Alert them if I stray off my path</div><div style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.4;margin-top:1px;\">Notified if you move more than 100 m from the line.</div></div>\n<div class=\"cf-toggle\" style=\"width:34px;height:20px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--beacon);position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;right:2px;top:2px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-cta-share cf-start\" style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"/></svg>Start sharing</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;\">You can stop any time. Sharing ends when you arrive.</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-session": {
    "caption": "Beacon → \"Share my live location\" — session-based walk, ends on arrival, timer, or Stop sharing (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\n<div class=\"bc-map\">\n<svg class=\"bc-grid\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#97C459\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M0 90 H320 M0 180 H320 M0 270 H320 M0 360 H320 M60 0 V560 M160 0 V560 M240 0 V560\"></path></svg>\n</div>\n<svg style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 9\">\n<path d=\"M70 460 C 120 380, 90 300, 150 230 S 230 140, 220 70\"></path>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"bc-route-dot\" style=\"top:78%;left:20%;\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:16%;left:66%;transform:translate(-50%,-92%);\">\n<svg fill=\"var(--beacon)\" height=\"32\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"32\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.5-7 11-7 11Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-session-card\">\n<div class=\"bcs-row\">\n<div class=\"bcs-avatars\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">T</div><div class=\"bc-avatar\">N</div></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;\"><div class=\"bcs-title\">Sharing with Thabo, Nomvula</div><div class=\"bcs-sub\">Walk to Musgrave Centre · ETA 6:52 PM</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bcs-stop\">Stop sharing</div>\n</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-offpath": {
    "caption": "Beacon → live session — off-path alert state: sharer sees the banner, the circle is notified (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"bc-map\"><svg class=\"bc-grid\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#97C459\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M0 90 H320 M0 180 H320 M0 270 H320 M0 360 H320 M60 0 V560 M160 0 V560 M240 0 V560\"></path></svg></div>\n<svg style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M60 430 C 80 360, 130 340, 140 280 S 90 200, 150 160 S 230 120, 225 70\" stroke=\"rgba(28,140,153,.16)\" stroke-width=\"34\"/><path d=\"M60 430 C 80 360, 130 340, 140 280 S 90 200, 150 160 S 230 120, 225 70\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 9\"/></svg>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:70px;left:225px;transform:translate(-50%,-92%);\"><svg fill=\"var(--beacon)\" height=\"32\" stroke=\"var(--beacon)\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"32\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.5-7 11-7 11Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></div>\n<div class=\"bc-route-dot\" style=\"top:352px;left:228px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:var(--amber);\"></div>\n<div class=\"offpath-tag\" style=\"position:absolute;top:366px;left:228px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--amber-tint);color:#633806;border-radius:99px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;\">Off path · 140 m</div>\n<div class=\"bc-session-card\"><div class=\"bcs-row\"><div class=\"bcs-avatars\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">T</div><div class=\"bc-avatar\">N</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div class=\"bcs-title\">Sharing with Thabo, Nomvula</div><div class=\"bcs-sub\">Walk to Musgrave Centre · ETA 6:52 PM</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"offpath-banner\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;background:var(--amber-tint);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 10px;margin-top:10px;\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--amber);flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:1px;display:block;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" ><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span><div style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;color:#633806;\"><b>You are off your path.</b> Thabo and Nomvula have been notified.</div></div>\n<div class=\"btn-row\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><div class=\"btn-flat ghost offpath-update\" style=\"padding:9px;font-size:11.5px;\">Update path</div><div class=\"btn-flat offpath-ok\" style=\"padding:9px;font-size:11.5px;background:var(--beacon);color:#fff;\">I am fine</div></div>\n<div class=\"bcs-stop\">Stop sharing</div></div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-add": {
    "caption": "Beacon → \"+\" — add to circle: search by name/number, send a request, mutual accept required before location sharing unlocks (updated — search by name/number, or find people from contacts via the shared contacts permission; request/accept only)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div><div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\">\n<div class=\"m-chat-header\" style=\"border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:8px;\">\n<div class=\"ch-back\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></div>\n<div><div class=\"ch-title\">Add to your circle</div><div class=\"ch-sub\">Search CivicNeuro residents</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-searchbar\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:9px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n<svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-soft)\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg>\n<span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);\">Search by name or phone number…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ll-addbtn\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;justify-content:center;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2Z\"></path></svg>Find people from my contacts</div><div class=\"m-badges-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n<svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 8v5M12 16h.01\"></path></svg>\n<div class=\"note-text\">Search by name or number, or find people from your contacts. A request only completes once they accept.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-sectiontitle\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">Results · 3</div>\n<div class=\"bc-request-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">M</div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Musa Khumalo</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Ward 12</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-pillbtn primary\">Request</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-request-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">L</div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Lindiwe Ngcobo</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Ward 12</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-pillbtn primary\">Request</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-request-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">D</div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">David Pillay</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Ward 9</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-pillbtn primary\">Request</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-sectiontitle\">Pending</div>\n<div class=\"bc-request-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">Z</div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Zanele Cele</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Wants to share with you</div></div>\n<div class=\"bc-request-actions\">\n<div class=\"bc-pillbtn ghost\">Decline</div>\n<div class=\"bc-pillbtn primary\">Accept</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bc-request-row\">\n<div class=\"bc-avatar\">S</div>\n<div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Sipho Dube</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Request sent · awaiting accept</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.4;\">Not finding someone? They may not be on CivicNeuro yet, or their profile isn't set to discoverable.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"phone-bottomnav\">\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item active\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-chat": {
    "caption": "Beacon → chat with a circle member — persistent, open any time; live-share status shows in the header (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div><div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-bottom:10px;\">\n<div class=\"m-chat-header\">\n<div class=\"ch-back\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ch-title\">Thabo Mkhize</div>\n<div class=\"ch-sub\" style=\"color:var(--beacon-deep);font-weight:700;\">● Sharing live location · 6 min to you</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;overflow:hidden;padding-top:6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\">\n<div class=\"m-chat-daylabel\">Today</div>\n<div class=\"bc-share-card\">\n<div class=\"bc-share-label\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path></svg>Live location started</div>\n<div class=\"bc-share-sub\">Thabo shared his walk to Musgrave Centre · ETA 6:52 PM</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-bubble-row org\">\n<div class=\"org-avatar\" style=\"background:var(--sage-line);color:#173404;font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:10px;\">T</div>\n<div class=\"m-bubble-wrap\"><div class=\"m-bubble\">On my way, taking the Florida Road side so I'll pass your gate</div><div class=\"m-bubble-time\">6:41 PM</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-bubble-row me\">\n<div class=\"m-bubble-wrap\"><div class=\"m-bubble\">Perfect, I'll watch for you 👍</div><div class=\"m-bubble-time\">6:42 PM</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"m-chat-input\">\n<div style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--beacon-tint);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 auto;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"13\" stroke=\"var(--beacon-deep)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path></svg></div>\n<input placeholder=\"Write a message…\" readonly=\"\"/>\n<div class=\"ci-send\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z\"></path></svg></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"phone-bottomnav\">\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div>\n<div class=\"nav-item active\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  },
  "node-contacts-explainer": {
    "caption": "Shared pre-permission screen — shown the FIRST time either Lifeline or Beacon needs contacts; explains both uses before the OS prompt (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div><div class=\"phone-content\"><div class=\"sh-hero\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2Z\"></path></svg></div><div style=\"font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Use your contacts?</div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0 14px;\">One quick permission covers both features — we only ask once.</div><div class=\"sh-use\"><div class=\"u-ic\" style=\"background:var(--ll-tint);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B03060\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg></div><div><div class=\"u-t\">Lifeline</div><div class=\"u-d\">Pick the people who get called when you tap Crime, Fire, Sickness, GBV or your own card.</div></div></div><div class=\"sh-use\"><div class=\"u-ic\" style=\"background:var(--beacon-tint);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1C8C99\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg></div><div><div class=\"u-t\">Beacon</div><div class=\"u-d\">Find friends and family already on CivicNeuro and add them to your circle.</div></div></div><div class=\"sh-once\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"></path></svg><div class=\"t\">Only people you add to a card or send a Beacon request to are saved. You can switch this off any time in your phone's Settings.</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 16px 16px;\"><div class=\"m-submit-btn\">Continue</div><div class=\"btn-flat ghost\" style=\"margin-top:8px;border-radius:99px;\">Not now</div></div><div class=\"phone-bottomnav\"><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  },
  "node-contacts-perm": {
    "caption": "ONE native contacts permission prompt — shared by Lifeline and Beacon; never shown twice (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"phone-content dim\"><div class=\"ll-title\">Contacts</div></div><div class=\"modal-backdrop center\"><div class=\"dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-icon warn\" style=\"background:var(--blue-tint);\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#185FA5\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2Z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-title\">Allow access to contacts?</div><div class=\"dialog-body\">CivicNeuro uses your contacts for Lifeline and Beacon. Native OS permission prompt — asked once for the whole app.</div><div class=\"btn-row\"><div class=\"btn-flat ghost\">Don't allow</div><div class=\"btn-flat primary\">Allow</div></div></div>"
  },
  "node-contacts-denied": {
    "caption": "Contacts permission denied — both features keep working without it; one place to switch it on later (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div><div class=\"phone-content\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding-top:20px;\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber-tint);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BA7517\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"></path><path d=\"M10.3 3.86 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"></path></svg></div><div style=\"font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-top:14px;\">Contacts access is off</div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.55;max-width:230px;\">You can still <b>type numbers</b> on a Lifeline card, or <b>search by name or number</b> in Beacon. To pick from your contacts, switch access on in your phone's Settings.</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 16px 16px;\"><div class=\"m-submit-btn\">Open Settings</div><div class=\"btn-flat ghost\" style=\"margin-top:8px;border-radius:99px;\">Continue without contacts</div></div><div class=\"phone-bottomnav\"><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  },
  "node-beacon-contacts": {
    "caption": "Beacon → \"Find from my contacts\" — your contacts who are already on CivicNeuro; request/accept still required (new)",
    "html": "<div class=\"phone-notch\"><div class=\"pill-notch\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"m-topbar\"><div class=\"m-menubtn\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>Menu</div></div><div class=\"phone-content\"><div class=\"m-chat-header\" style=\"border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:6px;\"><div class=\"ch-back\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></div><div><div class=\"ch-title\">Find from my contacts</div><div class=\"ch-sub\">3 of your contacts are on CivicNeuro</div></div></div><div class=\"m-sectiontitle\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">On CivicNeuro</div><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">T</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Thabo Mkhize</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">In your contacts</div></div><div class=\"bc-pillbtn primary\">Request</div></div><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">L</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Lindiwe Ngcobo</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">In your contacts</div></div><div class=\"bc-pillbtn primary\">Request</div></div><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">S</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Sipho Dube</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Request sent · awaiting accept</div></div></div><div class=\"m-sectiontitle\">Not on CivicNeuro yet</div><div class=\"bc-request-row\"><div class=\"bc-avatar\">G</div><div class=\"bc-text\"><div class=\"bc-name\">Gogo</div><div class=\"bc-meta\">Invite by SMS</div></div><div class=\"bc-pillbtn ghost\">Invite</div></div><div class=\"m-badges-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 8v5M12 16h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"note-text\">Numbers are matched securely to find residents. Contacts who aren't on CivicNeuro are never saved.</div></div></div><div class=\"phone-bottomnav\"><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3-8.7A2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .3 2 .7 3a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 10.3a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-1.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-.5c1 .3 2 .5 3 .6a2 2 0 0 1 1.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 2a9 9 0 0 1 8 7.94\"></path><path d=\"M14.05 6A5 5 0 0 1 18 10\"></path></svg>Lifeline</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg>Home</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path></svg>Reports</div><div class=\"nav-item\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"></path></svg>Alerts</div><div class=\"nav-item active\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.6 7-12.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.4 12 22 12 22Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.3\"></circle></svg>Beacon</div>"
  }
}